# Decimal digit counts are exact even above 2^53.
let values be a list of 0, 42, minus 90210, 9007199254740993.
let widths be map every n in values to (digits of n).
assert (widths at 0) is equal to 1.
assert (widths at 1) is equal to 2.
assert (widths at 2) is equal to 5.
assert (widths at 3) is equal to 16.
print widths.
